									"font": "Arial;13;0",
									"left": 1240,
									"top": 512,
									"width": 380,
									"height": 104,
									"text": "Step 11 : Alternative scenario\nUnable to communicate with the database\n11.1 Display an error message\n11.2 The scenario stops\nIn the nominal scenario, communication is correct"
								},
