									"top": 632,
									"width": 380,
									"height": 104,
									"text": "Step 14 : Alternative scenario\nAnother interview is already scheduled for this time slot\n14.1 Display an error message\n14.2 The scenario stops\nIn the nominal scenario, the time slot is free"
								},
