									"font": "Arial;13;0",
									"left": 1240,
									"top": 752,
									"width": 380,
									"height": 104,
									"text": "Step 18 : Alternative scenario\nThe interview could not be updated\n18.1 Display an error message\n18.2 The scenario stops\nIn the nominal scenario, the interview is successfully updated"
								}
							]
